@startuml KTOB_08_sequence_reading_journal
title KTOB — Update Reading and Add Private Journal Note
actor Reader
participant "Angular UI" as UI
participant "Java API" as API
participant "Identity guard" as Guard
participant "Library / Journal" as Library
database "Supabase Postgres" as DB
Reader -> UI : Open a personal library entry
Reader -> UI : Start or resume reading
UI -> API : Create/update reading experience
API -> Guard : validate owner
Guard --> API : readerId
API -> Library : record status/progress
alt Rereading a previously finished work
 Library -> DB : create NEW reading experience
else Continuing current experience
 Library -> DB : update chosen experience
end
DB --> Library : saved
Library --> UI : experience record
opt Reader writes a reflection
 Reader -> UI : Enter free-form note
 Reader -> UI : Set AI-context permission for note
 UI -> API : Save journal reflection
 API -> Guard : verify reader owns experience
 Guard --> API : allowed
 API -> Library : save reflection + exclusion flag
 Library -> DB : persist reflection
 DB --> Library : saved
 Library --> UI : journal note
end
UI --> Reader : current experience and notes
note over Library,DB
Separate reading experiences preserve old ratings and dates.
Notes are never required to update progress.
end note
@enduml
